{
  "bookId": "hero-215003",
  "id": "bond-28527",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28527001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "咚咚，滴答，当，当当——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28527003",
              "text": "在做新曲子吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28527003",
              "text": "这是什么声音？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28527002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "欢迎的转译，意思是「很高兴，见到你」~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真厉害，不过转译是什么意思？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "首先把文字转译成数字，然后用音乐编码的方式把数组转换成曲谱，就是你听到的旋律了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好厉害，除了厉害不知道该说什么了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不愧是「梦幻之音」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "滴——答答答，咚——哒哒，滴答咚答滴——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是……好熟悉……是不是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "是主人最喜欢的游戏BGM，我重编了节奏和副歌部分，用主人最近常看的动漫OP。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28527012",
              "text": "听起来热情又治愈呢。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28527011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "不过很可惜……到现在都没想好要怎样填词……果然写歌词这种事，我还是不太擅长阿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没关系，单听旋律就能够理解到心意了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不如我来帮助真恋填词怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28527015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "真、真的吗，谢谢主人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
